{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_934.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"a282f2d5246f85644a19656d98ae3f9b1746e33b8b3652d180ed5f19652f161d","ja":"あら、まだ誰も戻って来てないのかしら？\n……まあ、いいわ。","zh":"哎呀，还没有人回来吗？\n……算了，也好。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_934.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"dd81f989fa52f6c0f17375bed080e7c8b7ccb7f7773f7c27c902b8b05a5f45d5","ja":"うさちゃん、お待たせ。\nいい子でお留守番してた？","zh":"小兔，久等了。\n有乖乖看家吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_934.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"f85a1b8c98061db49239b29e0567974268bb4388b26d85090d97bb8b8b43ca56","ja":"……あらっ？\nなにかしらこれ……カード……？","zh":"……哎呀？\n这是什么……卡片……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_934.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"e49e5916f0db01ad61caaa176914de24cd665dfdb9296e9ac46447a07630a2f7","ja":"ねえ、うさちゃん。\nこれ、誰が置いていったか見なかったかしら……？","zh":"呐，小兔。\n你有看到是谁把这个放在这里的吗……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_934.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"50763a30da513cfadb04be9a07c7460061e150837086cffcf51569db2a452f92","ja":"おや？\n伊織ちゃん、誰とお話しているんですか～？","zh":"哦？\n伊織，你在跟谁说话呀～？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_934.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"5bedb20cdd159c71e85f6baf174861a48770a94867d441565764052766c47bfc","ja":"きゃ～っ！\nな、な、な……なんでもないわ！！","zh":"呀——！\n没、没、没……没什么！！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_934.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"f64cda22e06a238589ac7272d297b1cf53cd54c16382ba73ef448efaad210594","ja":"……そ、そう。これよ、これ！　カードが\n置いてあったから、メッセージを読んでただけで……。","zh":"……是、是啦。就是这个！因为卡片\n放在那里，我只是在读留言……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_934.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"3de3eec43f327d8910b0f1efb6e5af060c80ba6e907253e5e39ab01c46076c9a","ja":"カードですか～。興味深いですな～。\n良かったら、私にも見せてください～♪","zh":"是卡片啊～。真有意思呢～。\n方便的话，也请给我看看吧～♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_934.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"373a3519316472421b0042f4419ef78e7f08d73ca9399c3615256c9ad925c393","ja":"どれどれ……『緊急指令！　月の兎たちは、\n宝が示す場所に集合せよ！　ミス・W』……？","zh":"让我看看……『紧急指令！月兔们，\n到宝藏指示之处集合！Miss W』……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_934.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"d9ba8e3e040dfbc54914ee29c70f63bcc8743b1caaec2a238c23c06dba89daa1","ja":"はて～……？　『ミス・W』は、\n私たちの公演の、歌織さんの役名ですよね～。","zh":"咦～……？ 『Miss W』是\n我们公演里歌织的角色名吧～。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_934.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"47e33acb3ebfd57ca19bfedd4605529a6febc58b8d24544762e88ed118e167a2","ja":"そうね。それを踏まえると……\n『月の兎たち』っていうのは、私たちのことね。","zh":"是啊。考虑到这一点……\n『月之兔们』指的就是我们呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_934.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"7a56666f83dd880ca0b7a48672e49951024e0cf617c32b174977036f7ebd830b","ja":"ですが、『宝が示す場所』というのはどこでしょう～？\r\nカードの真ん中に、宝箱の絵が描いてありますが……。","zh":"但是，『宝が示す場所』是在哪里呢～？\n卡片的正中间画着宝箱的图案……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_934.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"16cef869279a04dc70d958b374692916d97eb378c3f0df1751c9eedd567e901d","ja":"あとは……反対の面の真ん中に、\n『765』と書いてあるだけで、場所はどこにも……。","zh":"剩下的……在反面的正中央，\n只写着『765』，地点却哪里都没有……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_934.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"3616d43a7d57696b267c35ffa5280d78498d748271bb6d25d7c9d0e0ebe5a8e3","ja":"『765』の文字の裏に宝箱の絵……。そっか、\n『宝が示す場所』って、あそこのことじゃないかしら？","zh":"『765』的文字背后画着宝箱……。原来如此，\n『宝物指示的地方』，是不是就是指那里呢？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
